stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Grounded
  Grounded --> Airborne: jump, high jump, or leave support
  Airborne --> Grounded: valid landing
  Airborne --> WallSliding: descending wall contact
  WallSliding --> Airborne: wall jump, high jump, or lost contact
  WallSliding --> Grounded: platform landing
  Grounded --> Dead: fatal hazard
  Airborne --> Dead: fatal hazard
  WallSliding --> Dead: fatal hazard
  Dead --> [*]
  note right of Grounded
    Support ring carries player
    Input changes relative speed
  end note
  note right of Airborne
    Retain world vx on departure
    Lower platforms recover falls
  end note
  note left of WallSliding
    Boosts are orthogonal effects
    Dash changes tangent speed
    High jump changes upward speed
    Glide caps descent
  end note
